OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for new #30m
OL,4,Aspecial needs school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a new #30m special
OL,7,Feducational needs and disabilities
OL,8,F(SEND) school have been approved.
OL,10,FLeicestershire County Council was given
OL,11,Fpermission on Tuesday to build a
OL,12,F252-space school on land off Kilworth
OL,13,FRoad near Husbands Bosworth in the
OL,14,FHarborough District.
OL,16,FThe district is the only one is the
OL,17,Fcounty without SEND "specialist
OL,18,Fprovision", the authority said.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
