OL,3,GNEWSAPlans approved for new #30m
OL,4,Aspecial needs school
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt also said the new school would
OL,7,Freduce its "current reliance on
OL,8,Findependent providers" and help address
OL,9,Fa "significant shortfall in SEND
OL,10,Fprovision across the county".
